n#final_evaluation.evaluation_evidence.episodes -> Manifest `derived_from` entry is not a valid @evidence[[...]] token. figures/budget_sensitivity.pdf.prov.json paper_data.json#final_evaluation.evaluation_evidence.episodes -> Manifest `derived_from` entry is not a valid @evidence[[...]] token. figures/budget_sensitivity.png.prov.json paper_data.json#final_evaluation.evaluation_evidence.episodes -> Manifest `derived_from` entry is not a valid @evidence[[...]] token. figures/historical_dependence_control.pdf.prov.json paper_data.json#final_evaluation.evaluation_evidence.episodes -> Manifest `derived_from` entry is not a valid @evidence[[...]] token. figures/historical_dependence_control.png.prov.json paper_data.json#final_evaluation.evaluation_evidence.episodes -> Manifest `derived_from` entry is not a valid @evidence[[...]] token. (+5 more; see /workspace/paper/scientific-evidence/verification-report.json) Fix or remove every dangling link, rerun `scientific_evidence.sh verify --root-dir <paper_dir>`, and repeat until zero dangling references remain.\n\tlibassuan.so.9 => not found\nattrs==26.1.0\ncertifi==2026.10.23\ncharset-normalizer==3.5.2\ncontourpy==1.4.0\ncycler==0.12.1\nflatbuffers==25.12.19\nfonttools==4.68.0\nidna==3.20\njsonschema==4.26.0\njsonschema-specifications==2025.9.1\nkiwisolver==1.5.1\nmatplotlib==3.11.2\nnetworkx==3.7\nnumpy==2.5.4\nonnxruntime==1.31.1\npackaging==26.3\npillow==13.0.0\nprotobuf==7.36.2\npsutil==7.2.2\npymupdf==2.1\npymupdf4llm==2.1\npymupdf_layout==2.1\npyparsing==3.3.3\npython-dateutil==4.0.0\nPyYAML==6.0.3\nreferencing==0.37.0\nrequests==2.34.2\nrpds-py==2026.9.1\ntabulate==0.10.0\ntyping_extensions==4.16.0\ntzdata==2026.6\nurllib3==2.8.0\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
